msgid "# Sequence Parallelism"
msgstr "# 序列并行"

msgid "## Overview"
msgstr "## 概述"

msgid "## How to use"
msgstr "## 使用方法"

msgid ""
"Sequence Parallelism (SP) shards the token dimension across tensor-parallel\n"
"ranks around the communication boundaries of transformer layers."
msgstr ""
"序列并行（SP）在 Transformer 层的通信边界处，将 token 维度切分到各个张量并行\n"
"（TP）rank 上。"

msgid "## Principle"
msgstr "## 原理"

msgid ""
"SP MoE shards the input along the token dimension in each\n"
"Transformer layer. Different TP ranks therefore process different tokens,\n"
"avoiding duplicate expert computation for the same tokens."
msgstr ""
"SP MoE 在每个 Transformer 层中沿 token 维度切分输入。因此，不同的 TP rank\n"
"处理不同的 token，避免了对相同 token 的重复专家计算。"

msgid "The main data flow of an MoE layer is:"
msgstr "MoE 层的主要数据流为："

msgid ""
"Different DP ranks may have different numbers of valid tokens. Therefore, the\n"
"buffer after all-gather cannot be treated as a contiguous sequence of valid\n"
"tokens; it must be unpadded and zero-padded according to each rank's local\n"
"token size. This keeps tokens sequence-sharded during expert computation and\n"
"reduces duplicate computation and unnecessary communication."
msgstr ""
"不同的 DP rank 可能拥有不同数量的有效 token。因此，all-gather 之后的\n"
"缓冲区不能被视为一段连续的有效 token 序列；必须根据每个 rank 本地的\n"
"token 数量去除填充并补零。这样可以在专家计算期间保持 token 按序列切分，\n"
"并减少重复计算和不必要的通信。"

msgid "Steps to follow to enable SP currently:"
msgstr "目前启用 SP 需遵循的步骤："

msgid ""
"- `tensor_parallel_size > 1`.\n"
"- `enable_expert_parallel` is set (MoE models only).\n"
"- `--additional-config '{\"enable_flashcomm1\": true}'` set `flashcomm1`"
msgstr ""
"- `tensor_parallel_size > 1`。\n"
"- 设置 `enable_expert_parallel`（仅 MoE 模型）。\n"
"- 通过 `--additional-config '{\"enable_flashcomm1\": true}'` 设置 `flashcomm1`"

msgid ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> **Difference from upstream.** Upstream vLLM enables MoE sequence parallelism only when `data_parallel_size > 1`, together with a supported all2all backend, expert parallelism, and `tensor_parallel_size > 1`. On vLLM Ascend, `data_parallel_size > 1` is not part of the enablement condition. Ascend FlashComm also supports the TP/EP topology with `data_parallel_size = 1`, so SP MoE can be enabled when DP is 1 as long as the conditions above are met. `data_parallel_size > 1` remains supported."
msgstr ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> **与上游的差异。** 上游 vLLM 仅在 `data_parallel_size > 1`，并同时具备受支持的 all2all 后端、专家并行以及 `tensor_parallel_size > 1` 时才启用 MoE 序列并行。在 vLLM Ascend 上，`data_parallel_size > 1` 并非启用条件的一部分。昇腾 FlashComm 也支持 `data_parallel_size = 1` 的 TP/EP 拓扑，因此只要满足上述条件，即使 DP 为 1 也可以启用 SP MoE。`data_parallel_size > 1` 仍然受支持。"

msgid "### FlashComm switch (Ascend only)"
msgstr "### FlashComm 开关（仅昇腾）"

msgid ""
"vLLM Ascend enables SP MoE through the FlashComm switch. The switch is still\n"
"required; SP MoE is not enabled from the parallel configuration alone."
msgstr ""
"vLLM Ascend 通过 FlashComm 开关启用 SP MoE。该开关仍然是\n"
"必需的；仅凭并行配置无法启用 SP MoE。"

msgid "To enable SP MoE, set `additional_config.enable_flashcomm1`:"
msgstr "要启用 SP MoE，请设置 `additional_config.enable_flashcomm1`："

msgid "On vLLM Ascend, SP covers two paths:"
msgstr "在 vLLM Ascend 上，SP 涵盖两条路径："

msgid ""
"- **SP MoE** (MoE models): the attention `o_proj` ends with a TP all-reduce,\n"
"  so its inputs are replicated on every TP rank. Feeding those replicated\n"
"  tokens directly into the experts duplicates compute and communication under\n"
"  expert parallelism. SP MoE keeps the expert inputs sharded by sequence and\n"
"  restores the expected layout at the MoE output boundary instead.\n"
"- **Dense SP** (Qwen3.5 dense family): dense checkpoints such as\n"
"  Qwen3.5-27B / Qwen3.6-27B / Qwen3.8-27B have no experts to shard, so SP\n"
"  applies to the whole decoder stack instead: hidden states and the residual\n"
"  stay sequence-sharded between layers, the RMSNorms run on the rank-local\n"
"  shard, attention (full attention and GDN linear attention) all-gathers the\n"
"  full sequence and reduce-scatters its sequence-parallel output projection,\n"
"  and the dense MLP all-gathers around its TP-sharded weights before\n"
"  reduce-scattering the partial output back to the shard. Each TP all-reduce\n"
"  is thereby split into a reduce-scatter plus all-gather pair around the\n"
"  layer boundaries, which reduces communication latency on prefill."
msgstr ""
"- **SP MoE**（MoE 模型）：注意力层的 `o_proj` 以一次 TP all-reduce 结束，\n"
"  因此其输入在每个 TP rank 上都是复制的。将这些复制的 token 直接送入专家\n"
"  会在专家并行下重复计算和通信。SP MoE 则改为按序列对专家输入进行分片，\n"
"  并在 MoE 输出边界处恢复预期的布局。\n"
"- **Dense SP**（Qwen3.5 稠密系列）：Qwen3.5-27B / Qwen3.6-27B / Qwen3.8-27B\n"
"  等稠密权重没有可分片的专家，因此 SP 改为作用于整个解码器栈：隐藏状态和\n"
"  残差在各层之间保持按序列分片，RMSNorm 在 rank 本地的分片上运行，注意力\n"
"  （全注意力和 GDN 线性注意力）对完整序列执行 all-gather，并对其序列并行的\n"
"  输出投影执行 reduce-scatter，稠密 MLP 则在其 TP 分片权重周围执行 all-gather，\n"
"  再将部分输出 reduce-scatter 回分片。这样每次 TP all-reduce 都被拆分为\n"
"  围绕层边界的 reduce-scatter 加 all-gather 组合，从而降低 prefill 阶段的\n"
"  通信延迟。"

msgid "### Dense models (Qwen3.5 dense family)"
msgstr "### 稠密模型（Qwen3.5 稠密系列）"

msgid ""
"For dense checkpoints of the Qwen3.5 family (model type `qwen3_5_text`,\n"
"including Qwen3.5-27B, Qwen3.6-27B and Qwen3.8-27B), the FlashComm switch\n"
"enables dense SP directly — no expert parallelism is involved:"
msgstr ""
"对于 Qwen3.5 系列的稠密权重（模型类型 `qwen3_5_text`，包括 Qwen3.5-27B、\n"
"Qwen3.6-27B 和 Qwen3.8-27B），FlashComm 开关会直接启用稠密 SP——不涉及\n"
"专家并行："

msgid ""
"Dense SP requires `pipeline_parallel_size == 1`. Pipeline parallel and\n"
"LoRA deployments keep the default all-reduce layout. When ACLGraph is\n"
"enabled, sequence parallelism aligns the graph capture sizes to multiples of\n"
"the tensor-parallel size automatically."
msgstr ""
"稠密 SP 要求 `pipeline_parallel_size == 1`。流水线并行和 LoRA 部署仍保持\n"
"默认的 all-reduce 布局。启用 ACLGraph 时，序列并行会自动将图捕获大小对齐\n"
"到张量并行大小的整数倍。"

msgid "#### Performance notes for dense SP"
msgstr "#### 稠密 SP 的性能说明"

msgid ""
"Dense SP targets prefill-heavy workloads. Unlike SP MoE it removes no\n"
"duplicate expert computation — every rank still runs the full-token GEMMs —\n"
"so the expected gains are more modest and workload dependent:"
msgstr ""
"稠密 SP 面向以 prefill 为主的工作负载。与 SP MoE 不同，它不会消除重复的\n"
"专家计算——每个 rank 仍会运行全 token 的 GEMM——因此预期收益更为有限，且\n"
"取决于具体工作负载："

msgid ""
"- The per-layer tensor-parallel all-reduces become reduce-scatter plus\n"
"  all-gather pairs of the same total communication volume. What shrinks is\n"
"  the elementwise work: the RMSNorms and residual adds run on the rank-local\n"
"  token shard, and the between-layer activations shrink by the\n"
"  tensor-parallel factor.\n"
"- Decode-heavy, small-batch serving may see little benefit or a small\n"
"  regression (twice the per-layer collective count plus tensor-parallel\n"
"  aligned batch padding); keep the switch off for such workloads.\n"
"- Larger gains require fusing the row-parallel GEMMs with their\n"
"  reduce-scatter; see [Matmul reduce-scatter fusion](#matmul-reduce-scatter-fusion)\n"
"  and validate on the target hardware before relying on it."
msgstr ""
"- 每层的张量并行 all-reduce 变为总通信量相同的 reduce-scatter 加 all-gather\n"
"  组合。减少的是逐元素计算：RMSNorm 和残差加法在 rank 本地的 token 分片上\n"
"  运行，层间激活量按张量并行倍数缩小。\n"
"- 以 decode 为主、小批量的推理服务可能收益甚微，甚至略有回退（每层集合通信\n"
"  次数翻倍，加上按张量并行对齐的批填充）；此类工作负载请保持该开关关闭。\n"
"- 更大的收益需要将行并行 GEMM 与其 reduce-scatter 融合；参见\n"
"  [Matmul reduce-scatter 融合](#matmul-reduce-scatter-fusion)，并在依赖它之前\n"
"  在目标硬件上进行验证。"

msgid "### Matmul reduce-scatter fusion"
msgstr "### Matmul reduce-scatter 融合"

msgid ""
"On supported Ascend devices, enable `fuse_gemm_comms` to fuse a\n"
"sequence-parallel, bias-free row-parallel projection with its token-dimension\n"
"reduce-scatter. The fused implementation supports BF16/FP16 with TP size 2,\n"
"4, or 8; unmatched graphs continue to use the unfused path."
msgstr ""
"在支持的昇腾设备上，启用 `fuse_gemm_comms` 可将序列并行、无偏置的行并行\n"
"投影与其 token 维度的 reduce-scatter 融合。融合实现支持 BF16/FP16，TP 大小\n"
"为 2、4 或 8；不匹配的图将继续使用未融合的路径。"
